{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500s, Armenia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tadevos is a priest. He is on a journey to find the monastery that suits for his goal of becoming spiritually closer to Jesus Christ. As he travels Armenia, the choices he makes will decide wheter he will reach his spiritual goal and how he will affect the political future of the country and the lives of the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanakan is a text based adventure. Its gameplay features viewing beautiful illustrations of locations which immerse you in the atmosphere, text descriptions of the events and choices in each location that affect the following story and gameplay. The game features several endings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645180?t=1758288712","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645180/9d31979072432bad2377433c9c1646346b37852b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758288712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645180/83c1ec09f7f6f555599840562c7d7fc1e6a57abe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758288712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645180/83c1ec09f7f6f555599840562c7d7fc1e6a57abe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758288712","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500s, Armenia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tadevos is a priest. He is on a journey to find the monastery that suits for his goal of becoming spiritually closer to Jesus Christ. As he travels Armenia, the choices he makes will decide wheter he will reach his spiritual goal and how he will affect the political future of the country and the lives of the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr